{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"mechanics-lesson04","version":1,"title":"解析力学","subtitle":"第4回 · 元の第4回・ダランベールの原理と一般化力","scope":"kaiseki_2026_fall_04.pdf、全12物理ページ。元の第4回・ダランベールの原理と一般化力。既存問題と重複する復習と長い証明の再現は出題しない。","sourceManifest":[{"file":"Kyoto_Univ/[2026後期水２]解析力学（数理）/授業資料/kaiseki_2026_fall_04.pdf","sha256":"bce250215f07e4ae6bf9c47640d4523dc4e4d40d3034a57a73fce9848b69dae6","pageCount":12,"reviewedPages":[6,7,10,11],"method":"原資料の抽出テキストと該当ページ画像を確認し、数式・記号・適用条件を照らし合わせた。板書写真は原画像を目視した。"}],"questions":[{"id":"mechanics-l04-q01","version":1,"prompt":"質量mi、位置ri、外力Fiの質点系に理想拘束がある。仮想変位δriを用いたダランベールの原理は？","answer":"\\(\\sum_i(m_i\\ddot{\\mathbf r}_i-\\mathbf F_i)\\cdot\\delta\\mathbf r_i=0\\)。","criterion":"慣性項と外力の差による仮想仕事が0と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"kaiseki_2026_fall_04.pdf","page":6,"imageKey":"bce250215f07e4ae6bf9c47640d4523dc4e4d40d3034a57a73fce9848b69dae6:6"}],"promptHtml":"質量mi、位置ri、外力Fiの質点系に理想拘束がある。仮想変位δriを用いたダランベールの原理は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi><mo>¨</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>δ</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i(m_i\\ddot{\\mathbf r}_i-\\mathbf F_i)\\cdot\\delta\\mathbf r_i=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"慣性項と外力の差による仮想仕事が0と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"mechanics-l04-q02","version":1,"prompt":"位置\\(\\mathbf r_\\alpha(q_1,\\ldots,q_n,t)\\)に対する、時刻固定の仮想変位をδqjで表すと？","answer":"\\(\\delta\\mathbf r_\\alpha=\\sum_j(\\partial\\mathbf r_\\alpha/\\partial q_j)\\delta q_j\\)。","criterion":"時刻変化の項を入れず、一般化座標による変化を足せれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"kaiseki_2026_fall_04.pdf","page":7,"imageKey":"bce250215f07e4ae6bf9c47640d4523dc4e4d40d3034a57a73fce9848b69dae6:7"}],"promptHtml":"位置<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf r_\\alpha(q_1,\\ldots,q_n,t)</annotation></semantics></math></span>に対する、時刻固定の仮想変位をδqjで表すと？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>δ</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta\\mathbf r_\\alpha=\\sum_j(\\partial\\mathbf r_\\alpha/\\partial q_j)\\delta q_j</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"時刻変化の項を入れず、一般化座標による変化を足せれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"mechanics-l04-q03","version":1,"prompt":"外力Fαと位置rαを一般化座標qjで表した。qjに対応する一般化力Qjは？","answer":"\\(Q_j=\\sum_\\alpha\\mathbf F_\\alpha\\cdot\\partial\\mathbf r_\\alpha/\\partial q_j\\)。","criterion":"力と位置の偏微分の内積を足せれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"kaiseki_2026_fall_04.pdf","page":10,"imageKey":"bce250215f07e4ae6bf9c47640d4523dc4e4d40d3034a57a73fce9848b69dae6:10"}],"promptHtml":"外力Fαと位置rαを一般化座標qjで表した。qjに対応する一般化力Qjは？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>α</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">F</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">r</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_j=\\sum_\\alpha\\mathbf F_\\alpha\\cdot\\partial\\mathbf r_\\alpha/\\partial q_j</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"力と位置の偏微分の内積を足せれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"mechanics-l04-q04","version":1,"prompt":"理想拘束のもとで、運動エネルギーTと一般化力Qjを用いるラグランジュ方程式は？","answer":"\\(\\frac{d}{dt}\\frac{\\partial T}{\\partial\\dot q_j}-\\frac{\\partial T}{\\partial q_j}=Q_j\\)。","criterion":"一般化力を右辺に持つ式を言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"kaiseki_2026_fall_04.pdf","page":11,"imageKey":"bce250215f07e4ae6bf9c47640d4523dc4e4d40d3034a57a73fce9848b69dae6:11"}],"promptHtml":"理想拘束のもとで、運動エネルギーTと一般化力Qjを用いるラグランジュ方程式は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>q</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{d}{dt}\\frac{\\partial T}{\\partial\\dot q_j}-\\frac{\\partial T}{\\partial q_j}=Q_j</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"一般化力を右辺に持つ式を言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"mechanics-l04-q05","version":1,"prompt":"速度に依存しないポテンシャルU(q,t)から力が導かれるとき、一般化力Qjは？","answer":"\\(Q_j=-\\partial U/\\partial q_j\\)。","criterion":"ポテンシャルの負の偏微分と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"kaiseki_2026_fall_04.pdf","page":11,"imageKey":"bce250215f07e4ae6bf9c47640d4523dc4e4d40d3034a57a73fce9848b69dae6:11"}],"promptHtml":"速度に依存しないポテンシャルU(q,t)から力が導かれるとき、一般化力Qjは？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_j=-\\partial U/\\partial q_j</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"ポテンシャルの負の偏微分と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"mechanics-l04-q06","version":1,"prompt":"\\(\\sum_j A_j\\delta q_j=0\\)から各Aj=0を結論するため、仮想変位δqjに必要な性質は？","answer":"互いに独立で、任意に選べること。","criterion":"独立性と任意性を言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"kaiseki_2026_fall_04.pdf","page":11,"imageKey":"bce250215f07e4ae6bf9c47640d4523dc4e4d40d3034a57a73fce9848b69dae6:11"}],"promptHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mi>δ</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_j A_j\\delta q_j=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>から各Aj=0を結論するため、仮想変位δqjに必要な性質は？","answerHtml":"互いに独立で、任意に選べること。","criterionHtml":"独立性と任意性を言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""}],"sourceImages":{"bce250215f07e4ae6bf9c47640d4523dc4e4d40d3034a57a73fce9848b69dae6:6":"./assets/sources/bce250215f07e4ae6bf9c47640d4523dc4e4d40d3034a57a73fce9848b69dae6-6.png","bce250215f07e4ae6bf9c47640d4523dc4e4d40d3034a57a73fce9848b69dae6:7":"./assets/sources/bce250215f07e4ae6bf9c47640d4523dc4e4d40d3034a57a73fce9848b69dae6-7.png","bce250215f07e4ae6bf9c47640d4523dc4e4d40d3034a57a73fce9848b69dae6:10":"./assets/sources/bce250215f07e4ae6bf9c47640d4523dc4e4d40d3034a57a73fce9848b69dae6-10.png","bce250215f07e4ae6bf9c47640d4523dc4e4d40d3034a57a73fce9848b69dae6:11":"./assets/sources/bce250215f07e4ae6bf9c47640d4523dc4e4d40d3034a57a73fce9848